# CameraX — project memory

Play Store camera app (`com.arindam.camerax`) built with Jetpack CameraX 1.6. Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, minSdk 23. Goal: show other apps what the CameraX library can do.

## Architecture (Clean Architecture, single module)

```
ui (presentation) → domain ← data
```

- `domain/model` — camera models with no CameraX / Compose types
- `domain/repository` — `CameraRepository`, `MediaRepository`
- `domain/usecase` — `CapturePhoto`, `StartRecording`, `BindCamera`, recording/zoom/flash/filter interactors
- `data/camera/CameraSession` — CameraX implementation of `CameraRepository`
- `data/camera/PreviewViewHost` — `CameraHost` adapter for `PreviewView`
- `ui/` — Compose chrome + `CameraViewModel` (UI state, countdown, bind revision)
- `di/AppContainer` — composition root; do not construct `CameraSession` from the UI

Keep use cases; do not collapse back to ViewModel → CameraSession. Do not split Gradle modules unless asked.

`CameraFragment` is a thin Compose host only. Do not resurrect the old View-based capture/flash/zoom code.

## CameraX rules

- Bind `Preview + ImageCapture + VideoCapture` together when possible; fall back (drop analysis, drop video, stills only) on `IllegalArgumentException`.
- Rebind only for lens, OEM extensions, face detection, or enabling/disabling the color `CameraEffect`. Zoom, torch, flash, and filter matrix updates must not rebind.
- OEM extension chips (HDR / Night / Portrait=`BOKEH` / Beauty=`FACE_RETOUCH`) only if `ExtensionsManager.isExtensionAvailable`. Extensions typically cannot bind with `VideoCapture`.
- Face boxes on **preview and recorded video** use `MlKitAnalyzer` + `OverlayEffect` (`PREVIEW | VIDEO_CAPTURE`), not a Compose canvas.
- Live filters: `ColorFilterProcessor` (`CameraEffect` subclass) for preview/video; same color matrix on still JPEGs.
- Media: photos `.jpg`, video `.mp4`. `Constants.FILE.EXTENSION_WHITELIST` must include both.

## UI

Immersive dark preview, glass chrome, accent `#f9aa33` (`CameraAccent` / `orange_500`), Work Sans. Modes: Photo / Video / Effects.

## Do not

- Force-push, amend pushed commits, or commit unless asked.
- Edit the plan file in `.cursor/plans/`.
- Require microphone as a hardware feature (`android.hardware.microphone` is optional).
